OL,3,GNEWSA'Burglars who raided my cafe have
OL,4,Abeen ID'd - but police aren't
OL,5,Ainterested'
OL,6,
OL,7,FA cafe owner has told of her heartbreak
OL,8,Fthat the burglars who ransacked her
OL,9,Fbusiness last month remain at large.
OL,11,FThe Engine Room Cafe, in the Hunslet
OL,12,Farea of Leeds, was raided on 14 July,
OL,13,Fwith those responsible causing around
OL,14,F#1,500 worth of damage and stealing
OL,15,Fmore than #500 worth of food and stock.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,390,380,200,160,0,100
