OL,3,GNEWSA'Burglars who raided my cafe have
OL,4,Abeen ID'd - but police aren't
OL,5,Ainterested'
OL,6,
OL,7,FFiona West, who has run the cafe since
OL,8,FMarch, said the incident had "knocked
OL,9,Fher for six" and claimed the police
OL,10,Fappeared to be "not interested" in
OL,11,Fcatching the burglars, with no arrests
OL,12,Fhaving been made despite customers
OL,13,Fidentifying them.
OL,15,FWest Yorkshire Police said it was
OL,16,Fmaking "further inquiries into the
OL,17,Fidentities of the suspects suggested".
